# ChatVia RAG Application - Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
This is a Laravel-based RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) application with Vue.js frontend using Inertia.js. The application provides AI chat agents with document ingestion, chunking, and knowledge management capabilities.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: Laravel 11+ with PHP 8.2+
- **Frontend**: Vue.js 3 with TypeScript
- **Bridge**: Inertia.js
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui components
- **Database**: MySQL/PostgreSQL
- **Queue**: Laravel Horizon
- **Python**: Use `uv` for any Python operations (already installed)

## File Structure Guidelines

### Backend (Laravel)
- **Controllers**: Organize by feature in `app/Http/Controllers/`
- **Models**: Keep in `app/Models/` with proper relationships
- **Jobs**: Use for async operations like file ingestion (`app/Jobs/`)
- **Data Objects**: Use for structured data in `app/Data/`
- **Services**: Business logic in `app/Services/`
- **Support**: Helper classes in `app/Support/`

### Frontend (Vue.js)
- **Pages**: Inertia pages in `resources/js/pages/`
- **Components**: Reusable components in `resources/js/components/`
- **Layouts**: Page layouts in `resources/js/layouts/`
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui components in `resources/js/components/ui/`
- **Composables**: Vue composables in `resources/js/composables/`
- **Types**: TypeScript types in `resources/js/types/`

## Code Style & Best Practices

### Laravel/PHP
- Use Laravel conventions (PascalCase for classes, camelCase for methods)
- Leverage Laravel's built-in features (Eloquent, validation, etc.)
- Use Data Transfer Objects for complex data structures
- Follow PSR-12 coding standards
- Use type hints and return types
- Implement proper error handling

### Vue.js/TypeScript
- Use Composition API with `<script setup>`
- Implement proper TypeScript typing
- Use Vue 3 best practices (reactive, ref, computed)
- Follow single responsibility principle for components
- Use props validation and default values
- Implement proper error boundaries

### Styling
- Use Tailwind CSS utility classes
- Leverage existing shadcn/ui components
- Maintain consistent spacing and sizing
- Use CSS variables for theme customization
- Follow mobile-first responsive design

## RAG-Specific Guidelines

### Document Ingestion
- Handle file uploads in `app/Jobs/FileIngestionJob.php`
- Use proper chunking strategies in `app/Jobs/ChunkJob.php`
- Implement proper metadata extraction
- Handle various document formats (PDF, text, etc.)

### Knowledge Management
- Organize agent knowledge files properly
- Implement proper file status tracking
- Use chunking for large documents
- Maintain proper relationships between agents and files

### Chat System
- Use Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time chat
- Implement proper streaming responses
- Handle conversation context effectively
- Use proper error handling for AI responses

